    "body": "Given this is a bug fix, and will be backported, we try to keep the code to what is needed to correct the critical bug for users in order to minimize code change and potentially destabilize code in the stable branch via other function such as new features. I think I might count validating the input - presumably checking all the labels as a new feature/improvement. If somehow you consider it vital its with this - otherwise I would consider it preferable on a separate PR that is not backported and would be part of next main release.",
